                        ],
                        "form": "die Seitenschiffe"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "da6f84f4-2510-3fab-a9ed-6615ef67a7ca",
                        "entry_id": "198f3595-45e5-3cc3-9755-81165b921e85",
                        "glosses": [
                            "langer, schmaler Raum an den Seiten einer Kirche"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6991c2a4-0565-4fd3-bd7f-ad11d257ac4b",
                                "sense_id": "da6f84f4-2510-3fab-a9ed-6615ef67a7ca",
                                "text": "Im Seitenschiff der Kirche leuchteten tausende Kerzen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "728f0b81-1ef7-4097-9baa-78acac410858",
                                "sense_id": "da6f84f4-2510-3fab-a9ed-6615ef67a7ca",
                                "text": "„Der Innenraum des gesamten Hauptschiffes war bei einer Breite von etwa acht Metern circa fünfundvierzig Meter lang; die Seitenschiffe hatten jeweils die Breite von drei Metern und mit den Säulen des Hauptschiffes betrug die Kirchenbreite etwa fünfzehn Meter.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2a973b6-0426-4688-8848-464b1c994aa1",
                                "sense_id": "da6f84f4-2510-3fab-a9ed-6615ef67a7ca",
                                "text": "„War dem Eintretenden die Anlage zunächst wie eine nach oben geöffnete Basilika erschienen, so hoben sich allmählich aus dem dunstigen Raumschatten zwei schmale Seitenschiffe, die durch wuchtige Säulen vom Mittelschiff getrennt wurden.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b11df96-deee-451e-a72b-585e42b3a3b5",
                                "sense_id": "da6f84f4-2510-3fab-a9ed-6615ef67a7ca",
                                "text": "„Derartige Zahlen ließen sich mit jeder größeren Kirche erreichen, die Seitenschiffe hatte und deren Seitenschiffe wiederum mit Altären ausgestattet waren.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9f40ddf7-a32f-4dc8-ab26-02f582b589fb",
                        "source_entry_id": "198f3595-45e5-3cc3-9755-81165b921e85",
                        "source_sense_id": "da6f84f4-2510-3fab-a9ed-6615ef67a7ca",
                        "source_sense_description": "Architektur: langer, schmaler Raum an den Seiten einer Kirche",
                        "target_lang_word": "aisle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aisle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1ef71db-7c9f-3dce-9607-f1a89718fabc",
                                        "entry_id": "399bfc8a-1530-3e76-ad25-42fd8e7e1da1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wing of a building, notably in a church separated from the nave proper by piers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e282897-d7cd-4945-b6a3-6e84142be8c9",
                                                "sense_id": "e1ef71db-7c9f-3dce-9607-f1a89718fabc",
                                                "text": "Hester Earle and Violet Wayne were moving about the aisle with bundles of wheat-ears and streamers of ivy, for the harvest thanksgiving was shortly to be celebrated, while the vicar stood waiting for their directions on the chancel steps with a great handful of crimson gladioli."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57b3da15-4116-458c-b5dd-0745f0d30d80",
                                                "sense_id": "e1ef71db-7c9f-3dce-9607-f1a89718fabc",
                                                "text": "In one of the aisles there was an elaborately carved confessional box and I recognised the village priest in his heavy mountain boots and black cassock as he entered it and drew the dark velvet curtains behind him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "abad08eb-2550-395e-9dc3-260f64bf324c",
                                        "entry_id": "399bfc8a-1530-3e76-ad25-42fd8e7e1da1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A clear path/passage through rows of seating."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c003c6a6-cf40-4319-a458-b6a6de143511",
                                                "sense_id": "abad08eb-2550-395e-9dc3-260f64bf324c",
                                                "text": "But the design of the '730s' wasn't just about the seating formation. The Metro-style walkthrough interior was chosen because it is much more spacious than the '323s', where the interconnecting doors between carriages, narrow central aisle, and cramped areas by the passenger doors had been deemed particularly constraining."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3640365b-87cd-3dbe-b9f0-d6cd5e5fe94d",
                                        "entry_id": "399bfc8a-1530-3e76-ad25-42fd8e7e1da1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A clear corridor in a supermarket with shelves on both sides containing goods for sale."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f523ac0-3f10-31a6-8b5c-feb3ca6ea7fe",
                                        "entry_id": "399bfc8a-1530-3e76-ad25-42fd8e7e1da1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any path through an otherwise obstructed space."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcf303c3-f349-46e2-8080-5a00b35aa540",
                                                "sense_id": "3f523ac0-3f10-31a6-8b5c-feb3ca6ea7fe",
                                                "text": "It is realised that the old Pullman standard sleeper, with its convertible \"sections\", each containing upper and lower berths, and with no greater privacy at night than the curtains drawn along both sides of a middle aisle, has had its day."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8dc878a-986e-38b9-88f8-1c9ff964df4c",
                                        "entry_id": "399bfc8a-1530-3e76-ad25-42fd8e7e1da1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Seat in public transport, such as a plane, train or bus, that's beside the aisle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cdfdeee7-32a3-4f7c-9f06-69ab19521387",
                                                "sense_id": "c8dc878a-986e-38b9-88f8-1c9ff964df4c",
                                                "text": "Do you want to seat window or aisle?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85636eb9-f82b-38f9-b4f9-f7ab7c9f9925",
                                        "entry_id": "399bfc8a-1530-3e76-ad25-42fd8e7e1da1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An idiomatic divide between the Republican Party and the Democratic Party, who are said to be on two sides of the aisle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ba4a664-0dc4-39cb-bf05-ea45977190c9",
                                        "entry_id": "399bfc8a-1530-3e76-ad25-42fd8e7e1da1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The path of a wedding procession in a church or other venue; (by extension, metonymic) marriage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7493abdf-5ab6-4c7d-a01c-9bde68d48e2d",
                                                "sense_id": "0ba4a664-0dc4-39cb-bf05-ea45977190c9",
                                                "text": "You ask her if she loves you, she answers, \"I do\" / Your heart starts glowing inside / And then you will know she is just for you / While each step, draws you closer to the aisle"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d5d9b33e-86fd-46ce-a8f3-4646ecabce3c",
                        "source_entry_id": "198f3595-45e5-3cc3-9755-81165b921e85",
                        "source_sense_id": "da6f84f4-2510-3fab-a9ed-6615ef67a7ca",
                        "source_sense_description": "Architektur: langer, schmaler Raum an den Seiten einer Kirche",
                        "target_lang_word": "bas-côté",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bas-côté",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d1754c2-32e3-3cf0-9d7e-3e759d4cbe1e",
                                        "entry_id": "46f87acf-d2e4-335a-a0e0-f5d11b252a0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nom donné à chacune des nefs latérales dont les voûtes sont moins élevées que la nef principale dans une église."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa39c007-37f8-3243-ae08-bb8647f30208",
                                        "entry_id": "46f87acf-d2e4-335a-a0e0-f5d11b252a0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bande herbeuse ou piste caillouteuse, le long d’une route."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Plus courant"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1c7d575-a8e2-4888-8b14-6c14d2198e55",
                                                "sense_id": "aa39c007-37f8-3243-ae08-bb8647f30208",
                                                "text": "— Je t’en supplie, mon maître, prenons, au moins, prenons un bas-côté de la route.\n— Pourquoi ? demanda Ouroz.\n— Les Pachtous suivent toujours le chemin de faîte, dit Zéré. Ils croient que, à ne pas le faire, ils attirent la mauvaise chance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af9d7408-7059-40ee-ab53-20c9894a0086",
                                                "sense_id": "aa39c007-37f8-3243-ae08-bb8647f30208",
                                                "text": "Une BMW était renversée sur le bas-côté."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2782ec9c-6e85-4826-a40b-c48157451a50",
                                                "sense_id": "aa39c007-37f8-3243-ae08-bb8647f30208",
                                                "text": "Enfin on peut de même, semble-t-il, rattacher à la prairie à Agrostis la végétation des bas-côtés des routes à leur traversée de nos forêts humides […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83d0b282-ac22-48da-aa54-bc4e97181ef5",
                                                "sense_id": "aa39c007-37f8-3243-ae08-bb8647f30208",
                                                "text": "Incapables de réparer les pannes de leur blindé faute de mécanicien en soutien, voire simplement de les ravitailler en essence, de nombreux soldats auraient été contraints de laisser leurs véhicules sur le bas-côté, pensent les experts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a555b7d7-0630-48cf-b966-7ec809021d21",
                                                "sense_id": "aa39c007-37f8-3243-ae08-bb8647f30208",
                                                "text": "La brouette est poussée tranquillement par Acar. Suit un cortège d'enfants.\nIls s'arrêtent à cet endroit précis du chemin que rien ne distingue du reste du bas-côté."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4ffd3b79-67ca-47a6-b793-6d23c67a0f0a",
